{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"document\">他不想因为这点新出现的不安，就破坏之前好不容易得到的快乐。再说，对方也没有答应过他什么，他也不想让自己的喜欢变成一种看不见的催促。\n\n于是，他试着让自己想开一些。他告诉自己，真正珍惜一个人，并不是每件事都要得到对方相应的回应。能够关心对方，能够为对方付出，能够真心为对方感到高兴，这些本身就是实实在在的快乐，又何必一定要从中得到一个保证呢？\n\n这样想并不是在安慰自己。他确实因此轻松了许多。之前那种想要确认对方心意的紧张，慢慢消失了。他发现，自己反而更愿意付出了。他不再小心计算自己付出了多少，也不再担心多付出一点，会不会让对方觉得自己更在乎这段感情。\n\n他为这种发自内心、不需要勉强自己的热情感到幸福。越是允许自己大方地去喜欢对方，他的内心就越充实，好像一直以来小心珍藏的温柔，终于有了足够宽敞的地方可以安放。\n\n那段时间，他甚至相信，自己已经找到了一种不会伤害人的亲近方式：只要不提出要求，就可以尽情地去爱，也不会失去什么。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9424b021-0c5c-4436-9e8f-6d9d42adb565", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002247070025Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.594, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:23:18.664708+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a74a02c3a76ad3c813e2d3dbd4851c85658f7965d4bd2a7756d79aba7ef8048b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002247070025Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "de42079f6c1789c8441435ac303d54827d50fb0f9fda7e7f66d73cd65929d221"}}}
